$.BP.P(0,A.aB([$.ot[1],A.aPJ("Back","Proceed","Friday","Monday","Saturday","Sunday","Thursday","Tuesday","Wednesday","The Neptun servers are working as hard as an average publicly funded road project...","You could have worked out your average by hand in this time...","Be patient, the servers are down because a rat got into them...","I'm more likely to believe there are penguins at the North Pole than that anyone has spent money on the Neptun servers...","Neptun servers are so reliable, I would do my banking on them...","Instead of an official mobile app, we got a website that also opens on a phone...","I would bet my house that you are still reading this because it is still loading...","Your phone would go up in flames if this was faster...","Still better than the non-existent Neptun mobile app...","Loads in any millennium now...","There's a power outage in the Neptun server room...","The Neptun servers are taking a coffee break...",'Did you know? "Neptun 2", the project this is based on, was created in about 1 week...',"Too slow? Sadly this one is out of NHNK's hands...","Just a second...","We are getting there...","Easy does it...","It's really loading something...","So, found it?...","Hold up! It can't do it that fast...","Forgot what you just read? Try taking B6 vitamins!...","april","august",o,"february","january","july","june","march","may",p,"october","september","No Data","Import","Click on the button, then select your freshly downloaded timetable file!","Bad ICS file!","Calendar use","Dont know where you can find your neptun timetable (.ics file)?",'Go to "My data" > "Settings" > "Calendar export"\nIf you want accurate data, select exporting from september 1. (xxxx.09.01), to the next years september 1. (xxxx.09.01)!',"Free Day!","This week is empty!","Classes this week: %0 %1. - %2 %3.","Thinking...","Class this week: %0 %1. (%2)","%0. education week","Copied!","Can't find your school in the list?","Items in the list above were added manually! It is possible that some institutes are missing from it.\nYou can log in via URL if you can't find your school.","Loading...","No network...","Search","Nothing found...","Select institute","Select a valid institute!","\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8/\ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7","ERROR! Please go back!","Provide valid credentials!","Invalid username or password!","Login","Log in","Logging in...","Neptun servers are having a hard time...","Neptun code","Password","Average: %0 %1","Scholarship index: %0 %1","Completed","You don't have any subjects","You have no grades","You don't have any messages","Sent by: %0","You received new grades in %0 subjects.",k,"You have a new grade!","You have %0 new unread messages.",k,"You have a new message!","All paid","%0Huf",g,"(%0 days since deadline)",g,"Break time","Expired: ","(%0 days ago)","(in %0 days)","Starts: ","Ghost grade","Select grade...",h,"Downloading language","Can't download, no internet","%0 - Installed from: ","Package Installer","Google Play","Outspoken loading texts","If you turn this on, loading texts will become outspoken.","Exam notifications","Exam notifications will send you notifications 2 weeks beforehand. It is useful if you like procrastinating studying, or tend to forget.","Notifications before classes","It will send you notifications 10 minutes, 5 minutes, and at the start of the class, so you won't miss them. Useful if you want to know what class you are going to have beforehand, without needing to check your phone (ex: You have a smartwatch)","Payment notifications","If you have payments due, the app will notify you every day, until they are paid. Useful if you tend to forget, or just don't want to miss a due date.","Period notifications","If a new period is about to become active, the app will notify you 1 day before the given period, and the day they become active. Useful if you don't want to miss something important tied to periods (ex: class registration period).","App haptics","You can set if you want the app to give you haptic feedback (vibrate).","Study week offset","Auto","If you have issues with the current study week, you can offset it to the correct week!","App language","Select what language the app shall speak to you.","App theme","Select how the app should look like","Downloading theme","Rate The App!","Do you like the app? Do you hate it? Rate it on Google Play!\nIt takes about 10 seconds, and it gives me and other users feedback.","Rate it","Message","Subject code:","Location:","Subject Info","Subject start time:","Taught by:","Exam Info","Exam start time:","There is an issue with your account","It seems like we can't fetch data from your Neptun.\nPlease log out, and log back in.","Logout","Update","Old App Version","This version of the app is outdated.\nPlease consider updating the app for the best user experience!","App Language","The app supports the language you are speaking.\nChange it if you want to.","Change","Ok","Missing Data...","Is there a problem with the app?\nTell me!","Calendar Use","You can load your timetable, if it was a calendar, but if the university makes a change with it, you will not have the latest one.\nYou should only use this, if you can not login into the app!","Institute selection","This is the simplest way. It is a list where you can search for your university, however, not all institutes can be found here!","Offline modes","Select login method",q,"If you can't find your university in the list, you can enter the Neptun URL of your school to log in. This might not work with all universities!","every %0 hours","every %0 minutes","Off","Check in the background","Looks for new grades a few times a day even when the app is closed. Only runs while connected, and skips when the battery is low.","Battery restrictions","Not restricted. Background checks can run at the interval you picked.","The system restricts this app, so background checks run rarely or not at all. Tap to open the setting.","Export timetable","Saves your timetable as an .ics file that your phone calendar can import.","Export ready, opening with your calendar...","Could not export the timetable.","New grade notifications","Tells you when a refresh finds a new grade in your markbook, so you do not have to keep checking manually.","New message notifications","Tells you when a refresh finds an unread message in your Neptun inbox.","Manufacturer restrictions","Your phone maker keeps its own list of apps allowed to run in the background. Tap to add NHNK to it.","Good afternoon!","Good evening!","Merry midnight!","Good night!","Good morning!","Good day!","You have %0 unread messages","You have spent %0Huf on university","Active","Expired","Future",n,"Your credits this semester: %0","Hello %0!","You are logged in here: \n%0","About","Bug report","Log out","You have logged out successfully!",h,"Support developer","Institute Neptun URL","This is not a valid Neptun URL! \n\nPaste something similar here:\nhttps://neptun-ws01.uni-pannon.hu/hallgato/login.aspx","Enter a valid Neptun URL!","Login via URL","Where do I find the URL?","Go to your school's Neptun website, and paste the link from up top. \n\nEx: https://neptun-ws01.uni-pannon.hu/hallgato/login.aspx","Calendar","Messages","Payments","Periods","Subjects")],s,r))
